  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="9ab43c45-f76c-5225-9da1-385651c8cd64" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Expose create/read/update/delete contracts; deletion and version-conflict behavior require code.&#10;Register once per subject; request-key replay returns the original identity.&#10;Members edit only their own permitted fields; staff own branch/status changes.&#10;Commit expected-version mutation, uniqueness marker, request key and history atomically; page at most 25 results.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
